        "title": "Casino Night (2 Player)",
        "text": "Casino Night Zone is one of the three levels of the two-player race in Sonic the Hedgehog 2 (Sega, 1992), and this is the music for it, a separate arrangement."
      },
      {
        "title": "A favorite tune",
        "text": "In the Sonic Stadium Soundtrack Squad Review (2010), the reviewer BlitzChris called the two-player tunes \"one of my greatest joys about the soundtrack\" and named this one his favorite of all."
